# {{NAME}} Agent Instructions

This workspace manages business clients, invoices, and contracts.

## Default Client Setup Flow

When asked to add a client or create an invoice/contract:

1. Ask only for missing blocking information (client name, rate, service description).
2. Run `manager-setup/scripts/bootstrap-item.sh <client-name>` to create the client folder.
3. Populate invoice and contract templates with provided details.
4. Run `manager-setup/scripts/update-inventory.sh` before finishing.
5. Report the client folder path and what was created.

## Defaults

- Owner: {{OWNER}}
- Currency: USD
- Payment terms: Net 30
- Status: active

## Blocking Questions

Ask before continuing when missing:

- Client name
- Service description
- Billing rate or project amount

## Inventory Requirement

The root `README.md` inventory is the source of truth. Always update it after any client change.
